5\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"284\"><strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"284\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"301\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"438\">\r\n<li data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"332\">⭐ Lichtgewicht en wendbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"372\">\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"372\">⭐ Geschikt voor precieze grasranden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"411\">\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"411\">⭐ Compatibel met Ryobi ONE+ accu’s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"438\">\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"438\">⭐ Eenvoudig in gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"460\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<li data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"527\">\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"527\"><strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"480\">Merk & model:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Ryobi</span></span> R18AG7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"557\">\r\n<p data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"557\"><strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"539\">Type:</strong> 18V Grastrimmer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"590\"><strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"569\">Accu:</strong> <em data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"588\">Niet meegeleverd</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"620\"><strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"603\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"640\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<li data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"675\">Alleen grastrimmer (zonder accu)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"699\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"732\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
